    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/72/Gloria_Flint_Warrior_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251223162343\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gloria Flint Warrior Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/72/Gloria_Flint_Warrior_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251223162343\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"685\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gloria Flint Warrior Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Gloria_Flint_Warrior_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>燧石战士</b>\n</p><p>尽管她身材矮小，但她的拳头有潜力击碎巨石，劈开汹涌的大海。\n她难以掌握要领，但她的拳头足够强大，足以构成威胁。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131456\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39523-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821131456 and revision id 64696. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
